# Frontend environment (optional).
#
# By default the frontend talks to the backend over the SAME origin:
#   - in development, Vite proxies /api and /ws to http://localhost:8000
#     (see vite.config.ts)
#   - in production, the FastAPI backend serves the built frontend from one
#     domain (https://addyourline.com), so no API base URL is needed.
#
# No build-time variables are required for the default setup. If you later host
# the frontend and backend on separate domains, introduce a VITE_API_BASE here
# and consume it in src/services/api.ts.
